         <description>
            <p>
                The repository provides a set of improved Pixinsight scripts from various authors as well as some newly written scripts.
            </p>
            <p>
               Updates:
               <br/>
               Astro Bucket List 0.12.1 corrects the display of Boötes throughout the interface and both finder-chart styles. Constellation imports also recognize ASCII, decomposed Unicode and legacy spellings. Documentation has been updated.
